    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18089" root="زمت" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِمِّيتٌ</span></b>  <i>Very grave, staid, steady, sedate,</i> or
<i>calm:</i> (S, K, TA:) <i>forbearing,</i> or <i>clement; quiet;
of few words;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِمِّيتٌ</span>: or, as some say,
<i>silent.</i> (TA.)

